          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}2x^2-8x-42&=2(x^2-4x-21)\\\\2x^2-8x-42&=2(x^2+3x-7x-21)\\\\2x^2-8x-42&=2\\bigl[x(x+3)-7(x+3)\\bigr]\\\\2x^2-8x-42&=2(x+3)(x-7)\\end{align*}$$",
