        "answer": {
          "short": "$5(x+2)(x+3)$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}5x^2+25x+30&=5(x^2+5x+6)\\\\5x^2+25x+30&=5(x^2+2x+3x+6)\\\\5x^2+25x+30&=5\\bigl[x(x+2)+3(x+2)\\bigr]\\\\5x^2+25x+30&=5(x+2)(x+3)\\end{align*}$$",
